			"notes": "## New Features\n- **Skin debug command**: \\/dnpc skin <id> debug\\ shows cache status, skin data preview, and applied state\n- **URL skin support**: Use a direct texture URL as the skin source (e.g., \\https://example.com/skin.png\\)\n- **Download logging**: Every skin fetch is now logged (success, failure, cache hit, cache miss)\n\n## Fixes\n- **Skin rendering**: Skins now properly sync from server to client via synched entity data, fixing the purple/black missing texture issue\n- **Renderer**: Uses \\PlayerModel\\ with \\getInsecureSkinLocation()\\ to display correct player textures"
		},
